{
  "id": "50",
  "title": "论兴亡",
  "guide": "本篇讨论“论兴亡”相关旧法。阅读时先提取月令、日主、透藏、制化与岁运等条件，再与其他章节交叉核对，不直接套用结果性断语。",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "夫人生柱中有纯杀为用也，杀神无制，则为白屋穷途之人、或一豪门营干之士；故要逢制杀运，假杀而起，进用朝廷，操权威福，功不可量。制伏运一入财乡，则能党杀，便兴祸患，如此官旺杀旺，运元恐失计。所以命党杀运，倘来生凶，偶然遇流年财杀少旺，杀神相党，併合兴殃；身主孤寒剋害，轻则倾家徒配，重则刑弃其身，故其杀神併合，凶亡之可畏也。有如此杀刃者，一一难免祸患焉。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "50-ee4a0a9faa6a856139b2-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "又有柱中月令，正气官星，为一生贵气，惟逢印运则利，盖官星喜逢财旺以生之，印旺以护之；故令其人能行仁布德、纬国经邦、权重爵高，所以贵也。后遇杀神旺乡，杀神禄位，岁杀併临，官化为鬼，丧身必矣。不行杀运、或逢伤官运，又无印綬制之，伤官得地，禄遭伤损，丧妻剋子，剥职生灾，立可见矣；更遇流年，儻他损官受剋，必致亡为惨恶。故欲官禄逢伤，而免剥戮者，不其难之乎？如有高见明识，知进退存亡之机，而保其身者；官禄逢伤，六亲免祸，亦当自己受恶疾而终者矣！",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "50-36f4cc23164f9faa1784-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "又有四柱中所专用神，无官杀气，惟偏财正财当旺而已；财神当道，隐隐兴隆，积财聚宝，但少贵矣！欲知且看行运如何？若财逢官禄旺之乡，又成富贵之局。设有不幸，财神脱局，阳刃相逢，财倾福败，多患其凶；及流年冲合阳刃，财神尽伤，元命衰绝，阳刃生凶，败亡极矣！",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "50-dabb00a7cbe1cac310ce-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "《宝法》第一",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "50-30e37abd67e64f9f2275-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "夫，稟阴阳而生天地间，故造化之赋于人也，稟造化而生；物亦如之，莫不由阴阳变化。是故，推人吉凶休咎，斯理昭著；然术家之法固多，究徵索子平之外未有矣！",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "50-810a97665d582054a03f-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "子平一法，专以日干为主，而取提纲所藏之物为令；次及年月时支以表其端。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "50-a88d0d59f97dfb52b5b5-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "凡格用月令提纲，勿于傍求年日时为格；今人多不知其法，于此百法百失。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "50-a48181c751ae5a4d9758-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "譬如月令，以金木水火土为要，但有一事而定言之，若于傍求，则有失误；取其月令实事，则以遍求轻重浅深格局破冲可也。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "50-f9b3d1dcb336aea68b7e-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "西山易鑑先生得其变通，将干格分为六格为重：『曰官、曰印、曰财、曰杀、曰食神、曰伤官』，而消息之，无不验矣！其法曰：『逢官看财，逢杀看印，逢印看官』，斯有奥妙不传之法。取四者不偏不倚、生剋制化，而遇破体囚为下运；有生有去为福，有助有剥为祸。其理深长，最宜消详切当；不昧庸术，宜熟读幸加勉焉。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "50-df4105d720f0dfea1443-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "《宝法》第二",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "50-2080e01f2d71464869c9-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "子平之法，以日为主；先看提纲为重，次用年日时支，合成格局，方可断之；皆以月令为用，不可以年取格。凡看子平之数，取格不定，十有九差。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "50-58893c3d29ffe6cb0ff4-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "惟易鑑先生之法，月令用金只用金，用火只用火；八字水多却取水，不来取火，况此差矣！以法断之，误其大半。是西山易鑑参透玄机，十八格内取六格为重，用相生，定格合局；仍用年日下，以推轻重浅深，万无一失。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "50-244a7ef8ad42288b40ef-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "六格法曰：『逢官看财』，『逢财看杀』，『逢杀看印』，『逢印看官』。如用印不怕杀；是杀拘印，印拘身，还作上格取之。如四柱逢印看七杀；但有官杀在，运行官杀乡，亦作贵格。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "50-19d95125103f4485cec4-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "月令通官，柱中遇财，财生官妙矣！乃富贵之格。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "50-095757fb1aed7feab99d-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "柱中见财，要人财旺，至兴发福矣！",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "50-307d825522824a7faa85-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "但见一杀，则以杀为重，不可又行财旺之乡；乃财生杀旺，当作贫贱之格。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "50-f808d3353d8ce4806613-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "凡格当以杀官言之。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "50-f6c934c140ab41581851-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "《寸金搜髓论》印净禪师",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "50-719ead7408c1af75e852-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "造化先须看日主，后把提纲看次第。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "50-d1aaf5324a2162d4455a-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "四柱专论其财官，身旺财官多富贵。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "50-24aaf18fc85050e9907d-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "若还身旺财官损，只是朝求暮讨儿。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "50-57c4e5d99c906fe59f1c-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "财官旺时日主强，紫袍金带有何疑。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "50-cbaa85f0abbfd13db2e4-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "财官旺而日主弱，运行身旺最为奇。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "50-b1deba0a759b61963739-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "日主旺而财官弱，运入财官名利驰。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "50-2db8d0ef81a765e7bf0e-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "日主坐下有财官，月令相逢贵不难。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "50-4a0a85a1bfbdbfd5d8f9-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "富贵财官为总论，早年富贵禄高攀。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "50-3d9b64b95a6ca450b8ef-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "身旺无依更迁祖，不迁居死在外地。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "50-46a2379973b0db6a2b14-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "身旺无倚，损财伤妻、或是外家冷落、或过房入舍。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "50-48b6a1bf14ed5ab0b7ad-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "身旺印旺，破财不聚；有财只好善破、或置物创屋、或门大而仓廩虚，内不足而外有餘。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "50-8bc3d2a1a2df9e9f844d-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "官喜露，露则清高。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "50-ff1df212ec061daa3f20-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "财要藏，藏则丰厚。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "50-6dd2eed40f4d3dbc8a1e-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "杀藏官露，恶隐善扬；人生遇此，名振乡邦。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "50-cb223f06354d64b69ab1-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "官杀太重身更强，一逢制伏作贤良。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "50-b39bfe819cf56e98a8da-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "杀官拱印贵非轻，烜赫威扬定振名。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "50-accc2e1dbf45b1ab9e8b-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "身居九夏火土多，相逢水济贵中和；水火元来要既济，管教名利振山河。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "50-4e2d03162dbd129f29f7-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "生居三冬，水冷金寒；得火相扶，莫作等閒。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "50-616ab4049460fc11a20d-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "火势炎炎如无水，运行水乡亦是美。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "50-9d3da1e5a53c2aec0711-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "水势滔滔若无火，运入火乡亦为奇。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "50-f34e4d625b7a3ff3cef4-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "南方火炎，利入北方水运。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "50-715091a396347d9dbdf7-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "北方水寒，利入南方火运。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "50-69faea1b943149a0ffdc-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "东方木多，宜入西方金运。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "50-7c87591b820b29ec4f04-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "西方金旺，宜入东方木运。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "50-b1f053679b7e22a78dc1-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "水火有既济之功。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "50-4c1b811c6c05ff9b9316-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "金木有成名之论。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "50-588d5eeb516b009f7c36-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "五行得其相济，威名荣振九天。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "50-670481af3a7d7bde8a10-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "三丘五行，辰戌丑未；若是重见，骨肉刑悲、父母不足、兄弟异离、亲戚情疏，更亏妻子。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "50-2fadf106c90334a3f7f8-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "冲破提纲，多亏父母，或是刑、或是离异。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "50-6470ce34f5d58ea555f2-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "身旺比肩坐驛马，兄弟飘蓬好潇洒。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "50-610c9552589966781f53-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "八字四马总交驰，身荣劳碌任东西；倘有身閒心不定，动则风流静则悲。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "50-23cc2190626db318b65e-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "财星入库主聚财。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "50-7e068253a8eeaa59070c-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "财星入库妻慳吝，谨守貲财不做人。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "50-e0fc992216ee9a65ea6f-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "若是财星坐四马，妻贤无处不欣欣。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "50-ec2616d79143b17957e6-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "官杀重重不带财，妻能内助不和谐；公姑不敬妻无礼，夺却夫权命所排。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "50-1dd1df90d6903ca693fc-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "官星若也逢生旺，更得长生旺在时；子息聪明多俊秀，儿孙个个著緋衣。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "50-84fd65864e79d65c2572-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "比劫伤官旺，伤妻更损儿；养子多不肖，乞养总非宜。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "50-c26fe61ea4f71d0acbba-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "日主七杀带梟神，妻主虚胎小产多，血气不调成血疾；更看行运又何如。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "50-1715bea4a996a5d39750-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "男子梟食重重见，身弱多因癆病随。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "50-6ea8631a93a1f2f75f44-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "女人梟食非为吉，产难惊人病亦危。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "50-8c061581a20dfcd34c8d-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "女人官旺兼财旺，招得贤夫更好儿；若是财官俱受损，伤夫剋子守空帷。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "50-2ca4c68183fe469faad6-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "印綬旺身身更旺，为人刑剋主孤贫；若得官显财又显，亦为超群拔萃人。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "50-b2ade49e91dd5d3c842b-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "惹是招非，只缘水火相剋，或是目昏眼暗。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "50-fe8838a7d923e3922244-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "女命若也伤官旺，坐下伤官会骂夫；朝暮喃喃口不绝，百年终见带刑孤。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "50-cf87a0db14788c5bb3cb-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "日如乙巳、戊辰、庚午、辛未，日干带之，权贵之妻也；更主贤妻亦主贵，更看四柱又何如。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "50-5313817f304b849f197f-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "又如丙子、丁丑、戊寅、己卯，生人遇此，皆因前道。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "50-af43d1e68c675ef1e0c2-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "辛巳、壬午、甲申、乙酉，俱是坐下财官，逢之富贵不少。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "50-e1c8ad14964eb2c1cc7e-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "丁亥戊子并庚寅，日主逢之命不轻。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "50-5327f027675789d3685a-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "辛卯丙申丁酉位，财官内隐显声名。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "50-a00d9a64fd0b9f3ad770-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "己亥甲申见庚戌，印綬财官内里藏；更得丙辰壬戌至，四时符印不非常。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "50-d6802e17ad60d0552a97-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "甲子丙寅与丁卯、己巳壬辰癸巳同，虚名虚利任飘蓬。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "50-5cad5c5ed4540ec1f83f-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "乙亥庚申并己巳，生下财官并无有；妻宫子女带虚花，东西南北是身家。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "50-5270a534ba1fa0eade03-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "甲午戊戌并庚子，女剋丈夫男剋子。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "50-72767eba4932fce6230a-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "乙巳丙午丁未同，重重壬子主孤穷。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "50-355dcc4a249a420b76ce-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "甲寅乙卯与戊午，支干同类子不足。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "50-8caf82fea745831f5a97-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "己未庚申及癸亥，月令更旺成祸害。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "50-23cddcaee2b8d0a42b2c-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "月主财官印綬全，月时符合福绵绵。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "50-f24bdb687b0ddebcc3cc-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "干支同类併身旺，剋子刑妻破祖田。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "50-fbd6381a9d6923abf99d-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "好将四柱分强弱，莫犯阴阳执一言；此是五行真妙诀，不逢智者莫虚传。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "50-e4fc2ff5c625a7e20aa5-0",
      "translation": null
    }
  ],
  "editionId": "yuanhai-6fbd3c1c68ee5326ccef",
  "version": "ca513874fd5e3ef7467b"
}
